  m_text: '1.  STUDY: Read the six verse cards and memorise their phrases before
    the timer ends.


    2.  CONNECT: Drag each phrase tile onto the medallion of
    the verse it belongs to.


    3.  BRIDGE: A hub joins two verses. Drop the phrase
    they share onto the hub.


    4.  HINT: Costs 75 points. Finish with no hints
    to collect all three stars.'
